			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"# MiniMax‑H3 T2VA 提示词优化方法论（针对你的15秒游戏PV案例）\n## 一、核心问题（你当前脚本容易踩坑）\n1. 多镜头+4种自定义遮罩转场，模型很容易**丢失转场效果、人物画风漂移、服装崩坏**\n2. 长文本多镜头，时序描述容易混乱，模型错读时间节点\n3. 复杂礼服多层裙摆，高速环绕镜头容易出现肢体穿模、裙摆撕裂\n4. 自定义符号（粉色耳朵小狐狸图标）容易变形、变成别的图案\n\n---\n## 二、5个实操优化方向，直接套用\n### 1｜结构拆分：长脚本做「分层约束」，不要全部堆进镜头描述\n✅正确写法：\n- 第一层：全局锁死（画风、角色、符号、禁止项，放在脚本最开头，**全局生效，每帧强制遵守**）\n- 第二层：分镜头时序描述，只写**该时间段内发生的动作、镜头、特效**\n- 第三层：转场单独标注，不要混在动作句子里；复杂遮罩转场**不要一次性堆4个**，优先保留2个核心转场，降低模型负担\n> 💡经验：H3对自定义遮罩能力有限，过多自定义遮罩容易失效，建议优先保留：扑克牌遮罩 + 狐狸面具碎片遮罩，另外2个转场作为备选，或者简化描述。\n\n全局锁死示例（放在脚本最开头）\n```\nGLOBAL_CONSTRAINTS:\nArt style: cel‑shaded anime game PV, reference character‑sheet painting style, clean line art, 24fps, clean transparent lighting, saturated non‑overexposed color.\nCharacter lock: female maid, long purple‑black hair, facial features unchanged, red‑black multi‑layer noble maid dress, keep costume silhouette all the time, no shape drift.\nSymbol lock: all rabbit‑related elements replaced by cute round little‑fox icon with big pink ears, maid‑logo style, fox icon shape keep stable.\nUniversal forbidden: no 3D, no realistic photo, no distorted limbs, no costume breakdown, no text, no watermark.\n```\n\n### 2｜镜头描述：减法原则，只写「动态」，静态细节放到全局约束\n❌错误：每个镜头反复重复写礼服蕾丝、刺绣、头发细节（文本冗余，模型混淆）\n✅正确：\n- 全局约束写死角色外貌服装；\n- 镜头内**只写运动：人物动作、镜头运镜、粒子特效、光影变化**；\n- 不要在单镜头内新增服装改动，服装形态变化写在全局。\n\n> 例：镜头4只写：`camera orbits 180° around character, multi‑layer skirt flutters naturally, cards and fox icons spin at high speed`，不再重复描述礼服刺绣。\n\n### 3｜运镜&动作：限定运动幅度，规避崩坏\nPV容易出问题镜头：180°环绕、眼部极速推镜、低角度仰拍\n优化写法：\n1. 环绕镜头：`camera slowly orbits 180 degrees around character, moderate rotation speed, avoid violent twisting`（缓慢环绕，限制旋转速度，禁止剧烈扭转）\n2. 眼部特写推镜：`camera moderate fast zoom‑in toward eyes，not excessive extreme zoom`（适度快速推近，不要过度极限放大，防止五官崩坏）\n3. 行走镜头：`character walks forward at gentle pace, dress skirt swings naturally, no limb penetration`（平缓步伐，裙摆自然摆动，禁止肢体穿模）\n\n### 4｜自定义符号（小狐狸图标）强化锁定\n模型很容易把小狐狸图标画歪、变色、变成普通狐狸。\n在全局约束增加：\n`Fox icon specification: keep consistent graphic shape, big pink ears, flat logo‑style icon, will not be deformed into real animal fox, keep graphic icon form all the time`\n> 释义：小狐狸图标保持统一图形样式，粉色大耳朵，扁平化logo图标，不要变成真实狐狸生物，全程保持图标形态。\n\n### 5｜音频精简，不要堆砌大量音效\n音效写太多会挤占视觉生成权重，优先保留核心3‑4种音效即可。\n```\noverall_soundscape: playing‑card rustle, fox‑icon sparkle sound, clock gear rotation, mask fragment shatter sound\nnon_diegetic_music: gorgeous mysterious anime PV bgm, string‑electronic mixed, fade out at 15s\n```\n\n---\n## 三、避坑要点（实战踩坑总结）\n1. **不要一次性写4种自定义遮罩转场**：H3原生对自定义遮罩、碎片遮罩支持有限，写越多越容易全部失效。优先2个转场做主力，剩下2个可以删掉，或者改成画面闪切，不写硬件级遮罩。\n2. 时长控制：15秒是上限，多镜头脚本尽量不要超过15s；镜头数量建议3‑4个最佳，5镜头会提升画面漂移概率。\n3. 负面禁止项，统一放在脚本末尾，不要打散到各个镜头。\n4. 角色造型参考图：如果是**文生视频（T2VA）没有输入参考图**，需要在全局约束反复强调角色特征；如果是**图生视频I2VA**，把角色锁定交给@图片引用，文本就可以减少大量角色描述。\n\n---\n## 四、优化后精简版完整框架（可直接复制使用）\n```\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\nGLOBAL_CONSTRAINTS:\nArt style: cel‑shaded anime game PV, character‑sheet illustration aesthetic, clean sharp line art,24fps,clean transparent lighting,saturated non‑overexposed color,smooth animation.\nCharacter lock: cold elegant maid girl, long flowing purple‑black hair, fixed facial features, elaborate red‑black multi‑layer noble maid dress, stable costume silhouette in every shot, no character style drift.\nSymbol lock: all rabbit‑related elements fully replaced by graphic little‑fox icon, cute rounded shape, big pink ears, maid‑logo flat icon style, never turn into real fox creature.\nUniversal forbidden: realistic photo,3D‑CG,thick oil paint,distorted limbs,costume breakdown,text,watermark,logo.\n\n[Shot 1]0‑3s: Girl stands on black‑and‑white checkered ground in front of retro red curtain. Spade A、heart A cards and glowing fox icons float around. Camera slowly pans down from upper body to ground, character keeps elegant posture. End of shot1:poker‑shape transition mask slides from screen edge to full screen within12 frames,5‑pixel feather edge,slight motion blur.\n[Shot 2]3‑6s: Low‑angle shot, girl walks forward, ornate high‑heels step on checkered ground. Mass of playing‑cards and luminous fox icons float around, huge Roman‑numeral clock as background. Camera slowly tilts up following footsteps, stardust particles flicker on ground, skirt layers swing gently.\n[Shot 3]6‑9s: Extreme close‑up of girl’s eyes, purple‑black hair falls on cheek, pupils reflect fox‑mask and giant clock, quick flash of breaking fox‑mask fragments. Moderate fast zoom‑in toward eyes, cold mysterious tone, calm expression. Fox‑mask fragment transition mask: mask shatters into pieces spread outward to cover screen.\n[Shot 4]9‑12s: Girl reaches out hand to touch spade A, large amount of cards and fox icons spin around her. Camera slowly orbits 180° around character, skirt flutters naturally, subtle space shuttle sense.\n[Shot 5]12‑15s: Medium shot, girl stands in surreal poker space, huge clock in background. Clock fan‑shaped pointer sweep across frame within10 frames. Keep character hairstyle、face、costume consistent.\n\noverall_soundscape: playing‑card rustle, fox‑icon sparkle sound, clock‑gear rotation sound, mask fragment shatter sound\nnon_diegetic_music: mysterious gorgeous anime PV soundtrack, string and electronic synth mixed, fade out at 15s\n\nForbidden constraints: blurry frame,malformed body,rabbit mask/rabbit pattern,overexposed highlight,heavy cluttered background,rough sketch lines,violent camera shake,unreasonable jump‑cut\n```\n\n如果你需要，我可以再输出一份**极致压缩版本**，专门适配H3短文本上限，进一步降低画风漂移概率。",
